<title>BELGIUM: Highlights of Friday's Commission briefing.</title>
<headline>Highlights of Friday's Commission briefing.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are highlights of the midday briefing by the European Commission on Friday:</p>
<p>In answer to a question, spokesman Jean Christophe Filori confirmed that the Commission would meet Dutch presidency officials in the Hague on Tuesday and hold its first meeting of the year on Wednesday.</p>
<p>No documents were released.</p>
</text>
